                                "sense_id": "27562cd4-4802-30e0-b95b-0535f17e176a",
                                "text": "You unhypnotize a chicken by poking its head out from under its wing so it can see again."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "352a84e9-265d-4710-b5b0-c3d5dc12870c",
                                "sense_id": "27562cd4-4802-30e0-b95b-0535f17e176a",
                                "text": "Like, what if a doctor figured out a word or a method that would unhypnotize them?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57a66992-200e-4f06-9036-0582758ec474",
                                "sense_id": "27562cd4-4802-30e0-b95b-0535f17e176a",
                                "text": "If this is hypnotism, unhypnotize him."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
